WEBVTT

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.020
[DRACULA LAUGHING]

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.511
Oh, honey,
look at those fluffy clouds.

00:00:30.121 --> 00:00:32.602
Remember what we played
when you were little?

00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:35.474
Hide and Go
Seek Sharp Objects?

00:00:35.648 --> 00:00:39.217
Okay.
Regular Hide and Go Seek.

00:00:40.044 --> 00:00:40.740
[MAVIS CHUCKLES]

00:00:41.698 --> 00:00:43.221
Where are you?

00:00:44.657 --> 00:00:45.571
[MAVIS CHUCKLES]

00:00:46.224 --> 00:00:47.530
Honeybat!

00:00:49.575 --> 00:00:50.707
Mavey!

00:00:52.535 --> 00:00:53.927
Honeybat!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.670
I'm gonna get you.

00:01:01.065 --> 00:01:01.761
[MAVIS PANTING]

00:01:03.546 --> 00:01:05.722
Honey? Are you okay?

00:01:05.896 --> 00:01:07.637
[SIGHING] Yes.
It's just a little harder

00:01:07.811 --> 00:01:09.943
to catch my breath
since I'm pregnant.

00:01:10.117 --> 00:01:12.250
Yes, well, I guess
that would make it more...

00:01:12.424 --> 00:01:13.469
What?

00:01:17.255 --> 00:01:17.995
[GASPS]

00:01:18.735 --> 00:01:19.605
[CHEERING]

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.087
I'm gonna be a grandpa!
[ECHOING]

00:01:25.089 --> 00:01:27.831
JONATHAN:
And I'm gonna be a dad!

00:01:29.659 --> 00:01:32.357
♪ 'Cause you're
Daddy's girl, or boy

00:01:32.531 --> 00:01:35.273
♪ Daddy's girl, or boy ♪

00:01:35.447 --> 00:01:37.101
I'm hungry again, honey.

00:01:37.275 --> 00:01:38.929
Can you get me
some ice cream with anchovies?

00:01:41.279 --> 00:01:43.455
No, no, no.
You mustn't give
in to your cravings.

00:01:43.629 --> 00:01:45.762
It's not good for the baby.

00:01:45.936 --> 00:01:47.851
You need to increase
your spider intake,

00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:49.330
so he'll be able to
climb ceilings properly.

00:01:49.505 --> 00:01:51.028
And eat lots of sheep bile.

00:01:51.202 --> 00:01:53.030
[BLEATING]

00:01:53.204 --> 00:01:54.945
I love you,
Dad, but we don't even know

00:01:55.119 --> 00:01:57.077
if the kid's
gonna be a vampire.

00:01:57.251 --> 00:02:00.080
I'd be thrilled if
the baby's human-y,
just like Johnny.

00:02:00.254 --> 00:02:03.214
"Human-y." With thousands
of years of Dracula genes.

00:02:03.388 --> 00:02:04.563
Not gonna happen.

00:02:04.737 --> 00:02:06.609
As long as the baby's healthy.

00:02:06.783 --> 00:02:09.002
Of course.
A healthy little vampire.

00:02:09.176 --> 00:02:10.482
Or human.

00:02:10.656 --> 00:02:13.224
Yes, a human who can
fly as a bat.

00:02:13.398 --> 00:02:15.879
Here. Just have
some monster ball soup.

00:02:16.053 --> 00:02:17.881
It's your mommy's recipe.

00:02:20.797 --> 00:02:21.711
Aw!

00:02:22.407 --> 00:02:24.540
Thank you, Dad.

00:02:24.714 --> 00:02:27.717
Just like you made
it when I was a kid.
My favorite. [CRYING]

00:02:39.598 --> 00:02:40.556
Sorry.

00:02:55.745 --> 00:02:58.486
Sir,
only the father is allowed
in the delivery room.

00:02:58.661 --> 00:03:00.837
Really? I mean, okay.

00:03:01.011 --> 00:03:03.056
He's the family, I guess.

00:03:05.015 --> 00:03:05.798
[CRYING]

00:03:08.758 --> 00:03:11.935
Oh, look!
It's a boy! It's a boy!

00:03:12.109 --> 00:03:15.852
The Dracula
bloodline carries on!

00:03:16.026 --> 00:03:19.203
No one will ever harm you
as long as I'm here,

00:03:19.377 --> 00:03:21.466
my little devil dog.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.033
Dad, can I hold my baby?

00:03:23.207 --> 00:03:25.383
If I were Dad,
I'd say yes.

00:03:25.557 --> 00:03:27.820
But I'm the nurse,
Francine.

00:03:27.994 --> 00:03:29.909
Here you go anyway.

00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:30.867
[GROANING]

00:03:32.346 --> 00:03:33.173
[KISSING]

00:03:34.174 --> 00:03:34.827
[GROWLING]

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:38.352
My bad.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:40.790
[GIGGLING] [APPLAUDING]

00:03:42.966 --> 00:03:45.055
Little Dennis is
a year old now. Wow!

00:03:46.709 --> 00:03:48.058
[BLOWS A RASPBERRY][LAUGHS]

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:51.104
Nice. Yeah. Cute kid.

00:03:54.064 --> 00:03:57.589
Okay, time for presents, guys.

00:03:57.763 --> 00:04:01.245
All right!
Let's do this boy up!

00:04:01.419 --> 00:04:03.377
Check out what I got him.
Bling!

00:04:03.551 --> 00:04:05.379
Wow. Is it cursed?

00:04:05.553 --> 00:04:07.381
Super cursed.
Only the best.

00:04:07.555 --> 00:04:09.688
Straight from the crypt.

00:04:09.862 --> 00:04:13.300
He's just starting to walk,
so maybe it's heavier than...

00:04:13.474 --> 00:04:14.258
[CRYING]

00:04:15.781 --> 00:04:18.088
Oh. You're okay, Denisovich.

00:04:18.262 --> 00:04:20.699
His name is Dennis.
Named after my father.

00:04:20.873 --> 00:04:22.919
It's not his vampire name.

00:04:23.093 --> 00:04:25.399
My little
Denisovichy-Weesovichy.

00:04:25.573 --> 00:04:28.141
Huh!
Are we sure he's a vampire?

00:04:28.315 --> 00:04:30.361
I mean,
not that it's a bad thing,

00:04:30.535 --> 00:04:34.495
but shouldn't he have fangs
and that pasty
skin you guys have?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.977
Technically,
you have until you're five
to get your vampire fangs.

00:04:38.151 --> 00:04:39.892
Oh, he'll get his fangs.
He's a Dracula.

00:04:40.066 --> 00:04:42.286
He's also half Loughran.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.332
Maybe he'd be
better off where we live.
There's more humans there.

00:04:45.506 --> 00:04:48.771
What?
Look how well he's playing
with the wolf pups.

00:04:49.946 --> 00:04:50.903
[SLURPING]

00:04:52.296 --> 00:04:55.778
We have a present.
I hope it's acceptable.

00:04:56.648 --> 00:04:58.476
"My First Guillotine."

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:01.653
Very educational.
Well played, Frank.

00:05:01.827 --> 00:05:05.048
It's great. Thank you.
We just have to
baby-proof that.

00:05:07.485 --> 00:05:09.487
Johnny, do you know
where you put
the rubber guards?

00:05:10.706 --> 00:05:12.446
Baby-proofing a guillotine?

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.015
So you cut your finger off.
It's part of the fun.

00:05:16.189 --> 00:05:18.452
She made me
baby-proof the whole hotel.

00:05:18.626 --> 00:05:20.977
Someone's overprotective.

